1
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,110
[EPIC]⚡ I can't believe our first day at MIT!

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,330
[EPIC]⚡ MJ, come on.

3
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:09,670
[EPIC]⚡ Pretend like you're not the happiest you've ever been in your entire

4
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,170
[EPIC]⚡ life.

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,460
[EPIC]⚡ I can't.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,200
[EPIC]⚡ I knew it!

7
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,620
[EPIC]⚡ Hi, my name is Peter Parker.

8
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,300
[EPIC]⚡ You don't remember me, but we used to know each other.

9
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,540
[EPIC]⚡ Something bad was going to happen,

10
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:39,060
[EPIC]⚡ and the only way to stop it was to make everyone forget

11
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:39,680
[EPIC]⚡ about me.

12
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,960
[EPIC]⚡ Because I'm not just Peter Parker.

13
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,140
[EPIC]⚡ I'm Spider -Man.

14
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:53,930
[DIALOGUE]🗣 Put your whimpering.

15
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,840
[EPIC]⚡ Suit yourself.

16
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,000
[EPIC]⚡ Go home!

17
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,180
[EPIC]⚡ And sometimes Spider -Man has to do the hard thing,

18
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:09,100
[EPIC]⚡ even if it breaks Peter Parker's heart.

19
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:14,860
[DIALOGUE]🗣 What is happening to me?

20
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,140
[EPIC]⚡ Excuse me, Dr. Banner.

21
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,240
[EPIC]⚡ I need your help.

22
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,680
[EPIC]⚡ What did you say your name was?

23
00:01:35,110 --> 00:01:36,430
[EPIC]⚡ DNA is mutating?

24
00:01:36,810 --> 00:01:38,470
[EPIC]⚡ Could be enormously dangerous.

25
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:43,590
[DIALOGUE]🗣 Spiders have three life cycles.

26
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:50,830
[EPIC]⚡ When between cycles, it can leave the spider vulnerable to threats.

27
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:54,170
[EPIC]⚡ We are faced with a danger that we can't control.

28
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:56,870
[EPIC]⚡ One we can't even see.

29
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,630
[EPIC]⚡ Stay out of my way.

30
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:03,430
[EPIC]⚡ You're losing it, kid.

31
00:02:05,170 --> 00:02:07,050
[DIALOGUE]🗣 And for those spiders who make it through,

32
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:11,440
[EPIC]⚡ it amounts to a kind of fever.

33
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:23,900
[EPIC]⚡ Nice flowers.

34
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,420
[DIALOGUE]🗣 Oh, they're a housewarming gift.

35
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:27,360
[DIALOGUE]🗣 I'm MJ.

36
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,400
[DIALOGUE]🗣 I'm just a neighbor from across the hall.

37
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,580
[DIALOGUE]🗣 A friendly neighbor.
